; F5a (friction-cn): reusable loopback relay HTTP/fault test support.
; `relay_test_support` is the scripted fault server — bound-before-fork
; loopback child; canned statuses (200/401/429/5xx), per-route response
; sequencing, delays (client-timeout tests), truncated bodies, malformed
; JSON, close-without-response, connection-refused helper, request
; capture; idempotent SIGKILL+waitpid stop. Generalized from H6's
; hand-rolled fake relay (test_c2c_list_relay is the proof migration).
; It serves canned/scripted responses ONLY — it is not a second relay.
; `relay_test_support_real` serves the PRODUCTION Relay_server
; (InMemoryRelay) callback over a pre-bound loopback socket (the
; test_pow_relay pattern) for suites that need real relay semantics.
; This F5a append COMPLETES the serialized H4->J1->H5->H6->F5a manifest
; lane: F5b/F5c adopt these libraries from existing stanzas (or
; coordinate a new lane).
(library
 (name relay_test_support)
 (modules relay_test_support)
 (libraries yojson unix))

(library
 (name relay_test_support_real)
 (modules relay_test_support_real)
 (libraries c2c_mcp relay_test_support yojson lwt.unix cohttp-lwt-unix))

